{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_036_01_b",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:71b3eaf6a3b5d21d4395de0aa2fb65f17428c568270091d57371d480bfd6653e",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_036rui_01_1_2_036_01:1_2_036_01_b:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:40912f07ca8ac43d06c47a0d6372aa1ec3558aa6f4fc8861064b76f39fb9ba57",
      "text": "Ah！是那件事啊。\nOf course，我记得哦☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_036rui_01_1_2_036_01:1_2_036_01_b:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de1903bcfc6bce7406570ad3b4ab6ee0f21f4dacfe908925ac1813276d8b0136",
      "text": "为了不忘记，\n被拜托的当天晚上我就拍了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_036rui_01_1_2_036_01:1_2_036_01_b:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:919e564c39b2481fd5cd42cbaa5ace7cefa80b3bfd0b4e8331d73ea9752fbfa3",
      "text": "等等哦，马上拿给你看。\n打开相册文件夹，然后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_036rui_01_1_2_036_01:1_2_036_01_b:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ab0dfbb1fc5e135b1065a79fc6f7fc683e3693f9764f799f6f0be7c319f46491",
      "text": "Let me see……给，请看☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_036rui_01_1_2_036_01:1_2_036_01_b:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:27e2fc8b3c6fedcf16641c97b73e58a0c47cf71a819f865d5a34829c62ef78e4",
      "text": "谢谢。\n我马上看看。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_036rui_01_1_2_036_01:1_2_036_01_b:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8720eaccdde2cac2d63316f5e0d21adf05ca24aad792317a5702bfd5da50edc5",
      "text": "这、这是……！\n该说是有个性呢，还是说东西堆得好乱呢……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_036rui_01_1_2_036_01:1_2_036_01_b:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c949c22ec361668f53b7d9973b717079f655b5857bfadffeb062e3e400987ea7",
      "text": "会吗？我倒不觉得呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_036rui_01_1_2_036_01:1_2_036_01_b:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f97d0309c12807f7de5b65cb1959a1183ff93e16a3b26ff2060ef5b9f85840a3",
      "text": "不过和Mr. 硲还有Mr. 山下的房间\n比起来，东西可能稍微有点多呢☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_036rui_01_1_2_036_01:1_2_036_01_b:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e8ff373d37a4a035a16a4d31f243688eb6f9904d76cde002130ab3eae665e70c",
      "text": "（……怎、怎么办？把这个房间\n原封不动播出去可能不太妙吧……！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_036rui_01_1_2_036_01:1_2_036_01_b:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:643c8fe1b9f9c0e2bcc3fc99ba5e493faf14e4cff5af31477a820d00712b2a91",
      "text": "……那个，类先生。我想和你商量一下……",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
